OL,3,ASchools in lockdown and boy in hospital
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Tuffley school and nearby Willow
OL,6,FPrimary Academy are locked down and
OL,7,Fofficers asked parents not to attend. A
OL,8,Fpolice spokesperson said there was "no
OL,9,Fongoing threat at the school" and
OL,10,Fpupils were safe within the school
OL,11,Fgrounds.
